<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>pygixml — the Python Giant XML framework</title>
<meta name="description" content="pugixml's C++ DOM, an inlined yxml streaming parser, and Cython. dictify, objectify, jsonify, and a CLI, all in one extension.">
<link rel="icon" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MohammadRaziei/pygixml/master/docs/images/pygixml-ico.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.9.0/styles/atom-one-dark.min.css">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.9.0/highlight.min.js"></script>
<script>
  tailwind.config = {
    theme: {
      extend: {
        colors: {
          brand: { DEFAULT: '#e67225', dark: '#c85a12', light: '#f2954f' },
          ink: '#0b0e14',
          card: '#12161f',
          muted: '#171c28',
          fg: '#e6e9ef',
          dim: '#8b93a7',
          hairline: '#232938',
        },
        fontFamily: {
          mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'ui-monospace', 'monospace'],
          sans: ['IBM Plex Sans', 'sans-serif'],
        },
      },
    },
  };
</script>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }
  .font-mono, h1, h2, h3, .brand-mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  .hero-glow {
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(230,114,37,0.22) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
  .text-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e67225 0%, #f2954f 50%, #e67225 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .btn-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e67225 0%, #c85a12 100%);
  }
  .btn-gradient:hover { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f2954f 0%, #e67225 100%); }
  .card-hover {
    transition: border-color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
  }
  .card-hover:hover {
    border-color: rgba(230,114,37,0.5);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px -12px rgba(230,114,37,0.25);
  }
  .grad-border {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(#12161f, #12161f) padding-box,
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(230,114,37,0.55), rgba(242,149,79,0.25)) border-box;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .hljs { background: transparent !important; padding: 0 !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="bg-ink text-fg antialiased">

<header class="sticky top-0 z-20 backdrop-blur-md bg-ink/85 border-b border-hairline">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5">
    <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
      <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MohammadRaziei/pygixml/master/docs/images/pygixml.svg" alt="pygixml" class="h-6 w-auto">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-dim border border-hairline rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5">v@PROJECT_VERSION@</span>
    </a>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
      <a href="docs/index.html" class="text-sm text-dim hover:text-fg transition-colors">Docs</a>
      <a href="benchmarks/index.html" class="text-sm text-dim hover:text-fg transition-colors">Benchmarks</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/MohammadRaziei/pygixml" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-brand hover:opacity-85 text-white text-[13px] font-semibold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M12 .3a12 12 0 0 0-3.8 23.38c.6.1.83-.27.83-.58v-2c-3.34.72-4.04-1.6-4.04-1.6-.55-1.37-1.33-1.74-1.33-1.74-1.09-.74.08-.72.08-.72 1.2.09 1.84 1.24 1.84 1.24 1.07 1.82 2.8 1.3 3.49 1 .1-.77.42-1.3.76-1.6-2.66-.3-5.47-1.34-5.47-5.93 0-1.31.47-2.38 1.24-3.22-.13-.3-.54-1.52.12-3.18 0 0 1-.32 3.3 1.23a11.5 11.5 0 0 1 6 0c2.3-1.55 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.66.25 2.88.12 3.18.77.84 1.24 1.91 1.24 3.22 0 4.6-2.81 5.63-5.49 5.92.43.37.81 1.1.81 2.22v3.29c0 .31.22.69.83.57A12 12 0 0 0 12 .3Z"/></svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero-glow text-center px-6 pt-24 pb-16 border-b border-hairline">
  <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MohammadRaziei/pygixml/master/docs/images/pygixml.svg" alt="pygixml" class="h-12 w-auto mx-auto mb-8 drop-shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(230,114,37,0.35)]">
  <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[13px] text-brand border border-brand/30 bg-brand/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-7">
    python &middot; giant &middot; xml &middot; framework
  </div>
  <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-[1.15] mb-5">
    The <span class="text-gradient">Python Giant XML</span> framework
  </h1>
  <p class="text-dim text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto mb-9">
    pugixml's C++ DOM, an inlined <a href="https://dev.yorhel.nl/yxml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-brand hover:underline">yxml</a> streaming parser, and Cython
    holding them together &mdash; <code class="font-mono bg-muted rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.9em]">dictify</code>,
    <code class="font-mono bg-muted rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.9em]">objectify</code>,
    <code class="font-mono bg-muted rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.9em]">jsonify</code>, and a CLI.
  </p>
  <div class="flex gap-3.5 justify-center flex-wrap mb-11">
    <a href="docs/quickstart.html" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gradient text-white font-mono text-sm font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">
      Get started
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </a>
    <a href="benchmarks/index.html" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-card border border-hairline text-white font-mono text-sm font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-all hover:border-brand/50 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
      See the benchmarks
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="grad-border max-w-md mx-auto rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <code class="font-mono text-[15px]">pip install pygixml</code>
    <button onclick="copyText(this, 'pip install pygixml')" class="text-dim hover:text-brand transition-colors" aria-label="Copy">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="flex flex-wrap border-b border-hairline">
  <div class="flex-1 min-w-[150px] text-center py-7 border-r border-hairline last:border-r-0">
    <div class="font-mono text-xl font-bold text-brand">Fastest</div>
    <div class="text-xs text-dim mt-1">wins most of the benchmark suite</div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-1 min-w-[150px] text-center py-7 border-r border-hairline last:border-r-0">
    <div class="font-mono text-xl font-bold text-brand">Most efficient</div>
    <div class="text-xs text-dim mt-1">lowest peak memory, streaming</div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-1 min-w-[150px] text-center py-7 border-r border-hairline last:border-r-0">
    <div class="font-mono text-xl font-bold text-brand">&lt;0.5&nbsp;MB</div>
    <div class="text-xs text-dim mt-1">installed, lightweight</div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-1 min-w-[150px] text-center py-7">
    <div class="font-mono text-xl font-bold text-brand">MIT</div>
    <div class="text-xs text-dim mt-1">License</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">

<section class="py-16 border-b border-hairline">
  <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand mb-2.5">Explore</div>
  <h2 class="text-[28px] font-bold mb-3.5">Everything about pygixml, in two places</h2>
  <p class="text-dim text-[15px] max-w-xl mb-10">
    API reference and guides on one side, honest performance numbers &mdash;
    refreshed on a schedule, not hand-edited &mdash; on the other.
  </p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    <a href="docs/index.html" class="card-hover block bg-card border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-4">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2Z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold mb-2">Documentation</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim mb-4">Quickstart, XML basics, XPath, streaming, dictify/objectify/jsonify, CLI reference, and full API docs.</div>
      <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand flex items-center gap-1.5">Read the docs
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="benchmarks/index.html" class="card-hover block bg-card border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-4">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-6 3 4 5-8"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold mb-2">Benchmarks</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim mb-4">Speed, memory, and install size against lxml, ElementTree, xmltodict, and xmljson &mdash; interactive, raw data one click away.</div>
      <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand flex items-center gap-1.5">See the numbers
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/MohammadRaziei/pygixml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-hover block bg-card border border-hairline rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-4">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 .3a12 12 0 0 0-3.8 23.38c.6.1.83-.27.83-.58v-2c-3.34.72-4.04-1.6-4.04-1.6-.55-1.37-1.33-1.74-1.33-1.74-1.09-.74.08-.72.08-.72 1.2.09 1.84 1.24 1.84 1.24 1.07 1.82 2.8 1.3 3.49 1 .1-.77.42-1.3.76-1.6-2.66-.3-5.47-1.34-5.47-5.93 0-1.31.47-2.38 1.24-3.22-.13-.3-.54-1.52.12-3.18 0 0 1-.32 3.3 1.23a11.5 11.5 0 0 1 6 0c2.3-1.55 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.66.25 2.88.12 3.18.77.84 1.24 1.91 1.24 3.22 0 4.6-2.81 5.63-5.49 5.92.43.37.81 1.1.81 2.22v3.29c0 .31.22.69.83.57A12 12 0 0 0 12 .3Z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold mb-2">Source code</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim mb-4">MIT-licensed, on GitHub. Issues, PRs, and the full build (CMake + Cython) welcome.</div>
      <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand flex items-center gap-1.5">Open on GitHub
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 border-b border-hairline">
  <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand mb-2.5">Why pygixml</div>
  <h2 class="text-[28px] font-bold mb-3.5">One package, every way to read XML</h2>
  <p class="text-dim text-[15px] max-w-xl mb-10">Pick the layer that matches what you're actually doing with the file, not one generic tree API forced onto every use case.</p>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
    <div>
      <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M12 2 2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5ZM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5">Raw DOM</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim leading-relaxed">pugixml's tree, directly &mdash; XPath 1.0, attributes, namespaces, the whole surface.</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg></div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5">dictify</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim leading-relaxed">XML &rarr; plain dict, same convention as <code>xmltodict</code> &mdash; drop-in, not a rewrite.</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 12h6M12 9v6"/></svg></div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5">objectify</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim leading-relaxed">Lazy attribute-style access &mdash; <code>root.child.grandchild</code> &mdash; nothing materialized until touched.</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 13h5"/></svg></div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5">jsonify</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim leading-relaxed">Direct XML&rarr;JSON, including <code>stream_dump</code> &mdash; flat memory, however big the file gets.</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20"/></svg></div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5">Streaming</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim leading-relaxed"><code>iterparse</code> / <code>iterfind</code> over yxml &mdash; process a file too big to ever load whole, one element at a time.</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-brand mb-3.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg></div>
      <div class="font-mono font-semibold text-sm mb-1.5">CLI</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-dim leading-relaxed"><code>pygixml cat</code>, <code>query</code>, <code>stream</code>, <code>convert</code> &mdash; XML from a shell pipeline.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 border-b border-hairline">
  <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand mb-2.5">Beyond speed</div>
  <h2 class="text-[28px] font-bold mb-3.5">What each library can actually do</h2>
  <p class="text-dim text-[15px] max-w-xl mb-10">
    Speed and memory aren't the whole story, and pygixml's scope isn't either
    &mdash; it's a <strong class="text-fg">Python Giant XML</strong> framework,
    built on pugixml plus a streaming yxml layer for the oversized case. A
    factual capability comparison, not a benchmark; static, so it lives here
    rather than in the generated report.
  </p>
  <div class="bg-card border border-hairline rounded-xl p-2 overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="w-full text-sm min-w-[640px]">
      <thead>
        <tr class="text-dim text-xs uppercase tracking-wide">
          <th class="text-left font-mono font-medium px-4 py-3">Feature</th>
          <th class="font-mono font-medium px-3 py-3">pygixml</th>
          <th class="font-mono font-medium px-3 py-3">lxml</th>
          <th class="font-mono font-medium px-3 py-3">ElementTree</th>
          <th class="font-mono font-medium px-3 py-3">xmltodict</th>
          <th class="font-mono font-medium px-3 py-3">xmljson</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="text-center">
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3">
            <div class="text-fg font-medium">XPath queries</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">Selecting nodes with an XPath expression.</div>
          </td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">Full XPath 1.0 (via pugixml)</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">Full XPath 1.0, plus EXSLT extensions</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">~</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">Small subset: no position(), limited axes</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">XSLT transforms</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">via libxslt</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">XML Schema (XSD) / DTD validation</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">via libxml2</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3">
            <div class="text-fg font-medium">Streaming, item-by-item parse</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">Process one element at a time without holding the whole tree.</div>
          </td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">iterparse/iterfind (yxml-based)</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">iterparse</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">iterparse</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">item_depth + item_callback</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">needs an already-built tree</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3">
            <div class="text-fg font-medium">Constant-memory XML &rarr; single JSON</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">Converting a file too large for RAM into one valid JSON document.</div>
          </td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">jsonify.stream_dump</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">streams dicts to a callback, not one JSON doc</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">Built-in XML &harr; dict/JSON conversion</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">dictify (xmltodict-compatible) + jsonify</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">needs xmljson</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">its entire purpose</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">needs lxml/ElementTree to parse first</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">YAML / TOON conversion</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">pygixml convert (optional deps)</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3">
            <div class="text-fg font-medium">Dotted / attribute-style navigation</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">doc.root.child.grandchild instead of find()/XPath.</div>
          </td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">objectify</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">lxml.objectify</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">plain dict access only</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">Command-line tools</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">cat, query, jsonify, stream, convert</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">Backend</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">C++ (pugixml + inlined yxml) via Cython</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">C (libxml2 / libxslt)</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">~</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">C accelerator, pure-Python fallback</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">pure Python, over stdlib expat</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">pure Python</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3"><div class="text-fg font-medium">Standard library (zero install)</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-t border-hairline">
          <td class="text-left px-4 py-3">
            <div class="text-fg font-medium">abi3 / stable-ABI wheels</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">One compiled wheel across Python minor versions.</div>
          </td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">cp310-abi3, covers 3.10+</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">&#10007;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">per-Python-version wheels</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">n/a &mdash; ships with the interpreter</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">n/a &mdash; pure Python</div></td>
          <td class="px-3 py-3"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">&#10003;</span><div class="text-xs text-fg0 mt-0.5">n/a &mdash; pure Python</div></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16">
  <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand mb-2.5">Usage</div>
  <h2 class="text-[28px] font-bold mb-3.5">Quick example</h2>
  <p class="text-dim text-[15px] max-w-xl mb-8">The same document, four ways.</p>

  <div class="flex gap-1 border-b border-hairline overflow-x-auto" id="ex-tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn font-mono text-[13px] font-medium px-4 py-2.5 border-b-2 border-brand text-brand whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="dom" onclick="switchTab('dom')">Raw DOM</button>
    <button class="tab-btn font-mono text-[13px] font-medium px-4 py-2.5 border-b-2 border-transparent text-dim hover:text-fg whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="dictify" onclick="switchTab('dictify')">dictify</button>
    <button class="tab-btn font-mono text-[13px] font-medium px-4 py-2.5 border-b-2 border-transparent text-dim hover:text-fg whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="objectify" onclick="switchTab('objectify')">objectify</button>
    <button class="tab-btn font-mono text-[13px] font-medium px-4 py-2.5 border-b-2 border-transparent text-dim hover:text-fg whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="jsonify" onclick="switchTab('jsonify')">jsonify</button>
    <button class="tab-btn font-mono text-[13px] font-medium px-4 py-2.5 border-b-2 border-transparent text-dim hover:text-fg whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="stream" onclick="switchTab('stream')">Streaming</button>
    <button class="tab-btn font-mono text-[13px] font-medium px-4 py-2.5 border-b-2 border-transparent text-dim hover:text-fg whitespace-nowrap" data-tab="cli" onclick="switchTab('cli')">CLI</button>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-content mt-4.5" id="ex-dom">
    <div class="relative bg-muted border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 pt-11">
      <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-dim hover:text-brand" onclick="copyCode(this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
      <pre class="font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-python">import pygixml

doc = pygixml.parse_string("&lt;root&gt;&lt;item id='1'&gt;a&lt;/item&gt;&lt;/root&gt;")
root = doc.root()
print(root.child("item").attribute("id").value())  # 1</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content hidden mt-4.5" id="ex-dictify">
    <div class="relative bg-muted border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 pt-11">
      <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-dim hover:text-brand" onclick="copyCode(this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
      <pre class="font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-python">from pygixml import dictify

data = dictify.parse("&lt;root id='1'&gt;&lt;item&gt;a&lt;/item&gt;&lt;/root&gt;")
# {'root': {'@id': '1', 'item': 'a'}} -- same convention as xmltodict</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content hidden mt-4.5" id="ex-objectify">
    <div class="relative bg-muted border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 pt-11">
      <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-dim hover:text-brand" onclick="copyCode(this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
      <pre class="font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-python">from pygixml import objectify

root = objectify.from_string("&lt;root&gt;&lt;item&gt;a&lt;/item&gt;&lt;/root&gt;")
print(root.item)  # lazy -- nothing parsed until accessed</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content hidden mt-4.5" id="ex-jsonify">
    <div class="relative bg-muted border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 pt-11">
      <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-dim hover:text-brand" onclick="copyCode(this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
      <pre class="font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-python">from pygixml import jsonify

json_str = jsonify.dumps("&lt;root&gt;&lt;item&gt;a&lt;/item&gt;&lt;/root&gt;")

# Too big to hold in memory as a tree? Stream it instead:
jsonify.stream_dump("huge.xml", "huge.json")  # flat memory, any size</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content hidden mt-4.5" id="ex-stream">
    <div class="relative bg-muted border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 pt-11">
      <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-dim hover:text-brand" onclick="copyCode(this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
      <pre class="font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-python">import pygixml

# yxml push parser under the hood -- never holds the full document
for record in pygixml.iterfind("huge.xml", "record"):
    print(record.tag, record.get("id"))
    record.clear()  # drop this element's memory before the next one</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-content hidden mt-4.5" id="ex-cli">
    <div class="relative bg-muted border border-hairline rounded-xl p-5 pt-11">
      <button class="absolute top-3 right-3 text-dim hover:text-brand" onclick="copyCode(this)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="h-4 w-4"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
      <pre class="font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code class="language-bash"># pretty-print + colorize
pygixml cat data.xml

# ad-hoc XPath from a shell pipeline
pygixml query data.xml "//item[@id='1']"

# convert between XML / JSON / YAML / TOON, any direction
pygixml convert data.xml data.json</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</div>

<section class="text-center py-16 px-6 bg-card border-y border-hairline hero-glow">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Ready to try it?</h2>
  <p class="text-dim mb-7">One <code class="font-mono bg-muted rounded px-1.5 py-0.5">pip install</code>, no compiler needed on the common platforms.</p>
  <a href="docs/installation.html" class="inline-flex btn-gradient text-white font-mono text-sm font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5">Installation guide</a>
</section>

